PREFAB beastieStatic
ENTITY beastieStatic 1
    COMPONENT TransformComponent
      VECTOR_3 position 2.0 -1.0 -2.0
      QUATERNION rotation 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0
      VECTOR_3 scale 0.5 0.5 0.5
    COMPONENT RenderComponent
      STRING meshName beastie.mesh
      STRING materialName
    START_CHILDREN
    END_CHILDREN
END_ENTITY